        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/31815d5df9ed6154b345e25749bdce14.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/31815d5df9ed6154b345e25749bdce14.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>NEW BOXING GAME WITH A REVENGE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to avenge your father? Clear your father's name after he was cheated out of his well-earned belt and train to win the Path of Glory tournament. Defeat your opponents one by one and become the ultimate champion. But learning to fight isn't the only thing you'll be doing: this boxing game requires you to make strategic decisions with card based game mechanics, and there are also chores you'll need to do to keep your day-to-day life going. Play a mini-game to tow a car and decide if you want to fight the car owner too! </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/029ffce42ac91505d38092bc56d1e514.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/029ffce42ac91505d38092bc56d1e514.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/029ffce42ac91505d38092bc56d1e514.mp4?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARD-BASED FIGHTING GAME - MORE THAN THROWING PUNCHES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes this the best boxing game is that you have to do more than just throw punches. Unlike many other fighting games, you have to plan your every move in the ring in advance using different cards. Sometimes you'll need to guard, sometimes you'll need to attack, and sometimes you'll need to throw your fist with all your might. By paying attention to the strengths and weaknesses of your enemies, you can build a deck of cards and use different strategies against each of them. The fighting moves you need to use will be different for each opponent. This boxing game encourages you to think smart and make strategic decisions! And thanks to English voiceovers, each fight will be a more immersive experience!<br><br>15 different opponents to fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 different cards your character can use for fighting moves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New card packs that can be unlocked after completing each training level</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 different card types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English voiceovers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/cb06ee6dae0eba35a2ea52a627987e17.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/cb06ee6dae0eba35a2ea52a627987e17.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/cb06ee6dae0eba35a2ea52a627987e17.mp4?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS FIGHTING GAME REQUIRES YOU TO TRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To succeed in the ring, you have to improve yourself, watch what you eat, train, and even keep your stress levels under control. Improve yourself with different workouts and become a better boxer. With each level, your character's stats will improve a little more. You should also pay attention to your fighter's hunger, stamina and stress levels. The fitter you are, the better you'll do in the ring!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 different workouts you can do</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 different foods your character can eat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 different training mini-games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/501072effb84c27a45248ec78a3be4f8.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/501072effb84c27a45248ec78a3be4f8.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/501072effb84c27a45248ec78a3be4f8.mp4?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/31815d5df9ed6154b345e25749bdce14.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/31815d5df9ed6154b345e25749bdce14.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>NEW BOXING GAME WITH A REVENGE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to avenge your father? Clear your father's name after he was cheated out of his well-earned belt and train to win the Path of Glory tournament. Defeat your opponents one by one and become the ultimate champion. But learning to fight isn't the only thing you'll be doing: this boxing game requires you to make strategic decisions with card based game mechanics, and there are also chores you'll need to do to keep your day-to-day life going. Play a mini-game to tow a car and decide if you want to fight the car owner too! </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/029ffce42ac91505d38092bc56d1e514.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/029ffce42ac91505d38092bc56d1e514.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/029ffce42ac91505d38092bc56d1e514.mp4?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARD-BASED FIGHTING GAME - MORE THAN THROWING PUNCHES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes this the best boxing game is that you have to do more than just throw punches. Unlike many other fighting games, you have to plan your every move in the ring in advance using different cards. Sometimes you'll need to guard, sometimes you'll need to attack, and sometimes you'll need to throw your fist with all your might. By paying attention to the strengths and weaknesses of your enemies, you can build a deck of cards and use different strategies against each of them. The fighting moves you need to use will be different for each opponent. This boxing game encourages you to think smart and make strategic decisions! And thanks to English voiceovers, each fight will be a more immersive experience!<br><br>15 different opponents to fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 different cards your character can use for fighting moves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New card packs that can be unlocked after completing each training level</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 different card types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English voiceovers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/cb06ee6dae0eba35a2ea52a627987e17.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/cb06ee6dae0eba35a2ea52a627987e17.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/cb06ee6dae0eba35a2ea52a627987e17.mp4?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS FIGHTING GAME REQUIRES YOU TO TRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To succeed in the ring, you have to improve yourself, watch what you eat, train, and even keep your stress levels under control. Improve yourself with different workouts and become a better boxer. With each level, your character's stats will improve a little more. You should also pay attention to your fighter's hunger, stamina and stress levels. The fitter you are, the better you'll do in the ring!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 different workouts you can do</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 different foods your character can eat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 different training mini-games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/501072effb84c27a45248ec78a3be4f8.poster.avif?t=1757437927\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/501072effb84c27a45248ec78a3be4f8.webm?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629050/extras/501072effb84c27a45248ec78a3be4f8.mp4?t=1757437927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
